## Supported Log Formats
| Format | Pattern Indicator |
|--------|------------------|
| syslog_rfc3164 | `<PRI>Mon DD HH:MM:SS` |
| syslog_rfc5424 | `<PRI>VER YYYY-MM-DDT` |
| CEF | `CEF:0\|` |
| LEEF | `LEEF:1.0\|` |
| JSON | `{...}` |
| Apache combined | IP - - [timestamp] "METHOD" |

## Dependencies
No external packages — Python standard library only.
