| Flag | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `-f <file>` | Memory dump file path |
| `--pid <pid>` | Filter by process ID |
| `--dump` | Dump matched content to files |
| `-o <dir>` | Output directory for dumps |
| `--yara-file <file>` | YARA rules file for scanning |

