- NIST SP 800-116 Rev. 1: Smart Card PIV guidelines
- Deviant Ollam - Physical Security Assessment methodology
- MITRE ATT&CK T1200: https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1200/$S$, '{"web_search","security_scan","shell_exec","create_deliverable"}', $S${"source":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","pack":"cybersecurity","domain":"cybersecurity","subdomain":"red-teaming","tags":["Design","Code","Testing","Analysis","Research","Security","Compliance","Cloud","Data"],"files":3}$S$::jsonb, true)
