| Snyk Severity | CVSS Range | SARIF Level |
|---------------|-----------|-------------|
| critical | 9.0 - 10.0 | error |
| high | 7.0 - 8.9 | error |
| medium | 4.0 - 6.9 | warning |
| low | 0.1 - 3.9 | warning |

