  YES --> [Initiate ACME Renewal]
              |
          [Complete Challenge]
          (HTTP-01, DNS-01, TLS-ALPN-01)
              |
          [Receive New Certificate]
              |
          [Deploy and Reload Server]
              |
          [Verify New Certificate Works]
```

