```
[Security Incident Detected]
(key compromise, CA breach, etc.)
      |
[Revoke Certificate with CA]
(provide reason code)
      |
[Verify in CRL / OCSP]
      |
[Issue Replacement Certificate]
      |
[Deploy Replacement]
      |
[Update Certificate Inventory]
```
