| `cert.issuer` | Get issuer Distinguished Name |
| `cert.not_valid_after_utc` | Expiration datetime |
| `cert.serial_number` | Certificate serial number |
| `cert.extensions.get_extension_for_oid(OID)` | Get specific extension |

