JSON report with supported protocols, accepted cipher suites, certificate details, vulnerability results (Heartbleed, ROBOT), and HSTS status.$S$, '{"security_scan","python_exec","create_deliverable"}', $S${"source":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","pack":"cybersecurity","domain":"cybersecurity","subdomain":"network-security","tags":["Code","Testing","Analysis","Security","Compliance"],"files":1}$S$::jsonb, true)
