| Keyword | Risk | Description |
|---------|------|-------------|
| RC4 | High | Broken stream cipher |
| DES / 3DES | High | Weak block cipher |
| NULL | Critical | No encryption |
| EXPORT | Critical | Weak export-grade cipher |
| anon | Critical | No authentication |

