## atomic-operator (Python)

```python
from atomic_operator import AtomicOperator

operator = AtomicOperator()
# Run specific technique
operator.run(
    technique="T1059.001",
    atomics_path="./atomic-red-team/atomics",
    test_numbers=[1],
)
# Run with custom inputs
